<div class="v-n-toi">  
  <div class="v-n-toi-selector">
    <span class="v-n-toi__pretxt">Selecciona primero <br> el sistema de juego</span>
    <div class="v-n-toi-selector__c">
      <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-selector__item" data-system="4/3/3">
        <span class="v-n-toi__system-label">4/3/3</span>
        <figure class="v-n-toi__system-img-c">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-433-mobile.webp" alt="" class="is-mobile">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-433-desktop.webp" alt="" class="is-desktop">
        </figure>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-selector__item" data-system="4/2/3/1">
        <span class="v-n-toi__system-label">4/2/3/1</span>
        <figure class="v-n-toi__system-img-c">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-4231-mobile.webp" alt="" class="is-mobile">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-4231-desktop.webp" alt="" class="is-desktop">
        </figure>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-selector__item" data-system="4/4/2">
        <span class="v-n-toi__system-label">4/4/2</span>
        <figure class="v-n-toi__system-img-c">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-442-mobile.webp" alt="" class="is-mobile">
          <img src="assets/images/toi-system-442-desktop.webp" alt="" class="is-desktop">
        </figure>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="v-n-toi-next-step">
      <span class="v-n-toi__pretxt">Selecciona tu sistema <br> para seguir avanzando</span>
      <div class="v-n-toi-ph">
        <span class="v-n-toi-ph__line v-n-toi-ph__line--01"></span>
        <span class="v-n-toi-ph__line v-n-toi-ph__line--02"></span>
        <span class="v-n-toi-ph__line v-n-toi-ph__line--03"></span>
        <span class="v-n-toi-ph__line v-n-toi-ph__line--04"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="v-n-toi-selected">
    <span class="v-n-toi__system-label" data-system-label></span>
    <p class="v-d-p" data-system-description></p>
    <span class="v-n-toi__pretxt">Elige tu once <br> jugador a jugador</span>
    <div class="v-n-toi-system v-n-toi-system--4-3-3">
      <figure class="v-n-toi-system__bg">
        <img src="assets/images/toi-system-bg.webp" alt="">
      </figure>
      <div class="v-n-toi-system__players"></div>
      <div class="v-n-toi-popup" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
        <span class="v-n-toi-popup__player-type" data-player-type></span>
        <ul class="v-n-toi-popup__players-list"></ul>
        <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-popup__close">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#fff" d="M2.333 23.333 0 21l9.333-9.333L0 2.333 2.333 0l9.334 9.333L21 0l2.333 2.333L14 11.667 23.333 21 21 23.333 11.667 14z"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="v-n-toi-system-footer">
        <div class="v-n-toi-system-footer__flag">
          <span>Este es mi once ideal</span>
        </div>
        <div class="v-n-toi-system-footer__site">
          <span>Haz el tuyo en</span>
          <img src="assets/images/logos/logo-abc.svg" alt="">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="v-n-toi-download">
    <div class="v-n-toi-download__btn-grp">
      <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-download-btn">
        <span>Descarga tu once</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="v-n-toi-reset-btn" title="Empezar de nuevo mi once ideal">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 22"><path fill="#1868ff" d="M1.1 15.05a8.3 8.3 0 0 1-.825-1.95A7.7 7.7 0 0 1 0 11.05q0-3.35 2.325-5.7T8 3h.175l-1.6-1.6 1.4-1.4 4 4-4 4-1.4-1.4 1.6-1.6H8Q5.5 5 3.75 6.763T2 11.05q0 .65.15 1.275t.45 1.225zM8.025 22l-4-4 4-4 1.4 1.4-1.6 1.6H8q2.5 0 4.25-1.762T14 10.95q0-.65-.15-1.275T13.4 8.45l1.5-1.5q.55.95.825 1.95T16 10.95q0 3.35-2.325 5.7T8 19h-.175l1.6 1.6z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="v-d-p">Aquí tienes tu pizarra táctica para el Mundial para descargar. Con estos once cracks sobre el césped, el camino a la gloria está mucho más claro. ¿Se atreverá el seleccionador a copiarte la alineación en el primer partido?</p>
  </div>
</div>